This reduced rate applies to the following items (and CN codes) for the exclusive use of the disabled (part 3):
- amplifiers for communication devices for people with impaired hearing (8518 40 91 and 8518 40 99);
- children special walkers, prone standers, wheelchairs (manual), special seats/buggies/wheelchairs (8713 10 00);
- wheelchairs (electrical) (8713 90 00)
